# This repository ships a SIGNED static bundle: scripts/rehash-manifest.py
# hashes the exact working-tree bytes and scripts/sign-manifest.py signs that
# manifest with the offline key. Git line-ending normalization silently
# rewrites blobs (CRLF -> LF) between the signing machine and CI/deploy
# checkouts, which breaks every signed hash. Content here is therefore
# byte-exact: no text conversion, ever, on any platform.
* -text
